  "title": "About Elogic Commerce | Ecommerce Development Company",
  "content": "Last updated:\nAbout Elogic Commerce - Ecommerce Development Company for Complex B2B & B2B2C\nElogic Commerce is an ecommerce development company specializing exclusively in ecommerce solutions across Adobe Commerce (Magento), Shopify Plus, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, BigCommerce, and commercetools. Founded in 2009, we deliver complex B2B and integration-heavy commerce projects - platform development, migrations, and integrations with ERP, PIM, and CRM systems. We are certified and partner-aligned across key platforms, supporting mid-market and enterprise clients in the US and Europe through dedicated teams and long-term support models.\nElogic Commerce is an Award-Winning, Certified Ecommerce Development Company\nAwards & Accolades\nOur people\nCollaboration and accountability\nWe provide end-to-end Magento development services keeping ourselves accountable for the successful release of your ecommerce website. To better understand how we work, check out how we divide responsibilities with our clients.\nowner\nCommerce\nowner\n- Business vision\n- Project requirements\n- Budget\nCommerce\n- Technical specifications\n- Project estimation\nowner\n- Backlog\nCommerce\n- Project development roadmap\n- Sprint demos\nowner\n- Feedback\nCommerce\n- Improvements\nowner\n- Deployment\n- Troubleshooting\n- Software upgrades\n- Additional feature development\nElogic Commerce's mission is to deliver solutions that become an essential part of your success\nLet’s talk\nElogic Commerce builds, migrates, and optimizes complex ecommerce systems for mid-market and enterprise teams. Tell us what you are working on — we will come back with an honest assessment of fit, scope, and timeline.\nReady to chat?\nReach out to receive a free consultation and entrust your IT initiative to a company that will help you manifest your vision and business approach into an ever-growing and adaptable business.",
